{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>特斯拉公司首席執行官馬斯克在深圳出席APEC相關活動，自稱是中國超級粉絲，又盛讚中國到處是壯麗景色。</p><p></p><p>特斯拉公司首席執行官馬斯克說：「我是中國的超級粉絲，我常跟美國以及其他地方的人說，不到中國看看就不能真正讀懂中國。中國值得看的東西太多了，坦白講到處都是壯麗景色，有令人驚嘆的建築及自然景觀。有一次我從北京坐高鐵，去西安看兵馬俑，那簡直就是世界一大奇觀。簡直震撼。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.MUSK.BITE-2000.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20267yJTZIxVsj1795091910.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T13:38:00.320239+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":183,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T12:26:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T13:17:18.841373+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T13:31:17.385598+00:00","content_hash":"35effda21ff99c53900cdbb3c6ad660fc415d5305d896a8c62903bcd44bebd85","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T13:38:00.320239+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}